            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1565] If the number of PriceSchedule elements provided by the secondary actor is not covering the entire time period until the EV has reached its mobility needs, it is in the responsibility of the EVCC to optimize the schedule based on the available information.",
            "block_bbox": [
                136,
